_:n7373f807d7a24a3a9ccaa3102efeeb23b5 <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#citationNote> "(Fiction: literature created from the imagination, not presented as fact, though it may be based on a true story or situation. Types of literature in the fiction genre include the novel, short story, and novella. The word is from the Latin fictiō, \"the act of making, fashioning, or molding.\")"@en .
