<http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026339> <http://id.loc.gov/ontologies/bflc/marcKey> "155  $aFiction" .
_:n7373f807d7a24a3a9ccaa3102efeeb23b6 <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#citationNote> "(Fiction: the general term for invented stories, now usually applied to novels, short stories, novellas, romances, fables and other narrative works in prose, even though most plays and narrative poems are also fictional.)"@en .
